<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060800VX" category="C" type-id="3007L" name-id="442OE-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C0226/21</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid FR System Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>C0236/22</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid FL System Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>C0246/23</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid RR System Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>C0256/24</dtccode>
<dtcname>ABS Solenoid RL System Malfunction</dtcname>
<dtccode>C1225/25</dtccode>
<dtcname>BA/TRC Solenoid Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060800VX_04" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000A3U00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>Each solenoid adjusts the pressure applied to each wheel cylinder to control the vehicle.</ptxt>
<ptxt>While a malfunction DTC is output, the solenoid relay is forcibly turned OFF by the fail-safe function, so the solenoids are not turned ON.</ptxt>
<ptxt>The solenoid relay and solenoids are built into the actuator.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.92in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.27in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C0226/21</ptxt>
<ptxt>C0236/22</ptxt>
<ptxt>C0246/23</ptxt>
<ptxt>C0256/24</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, an open or short in a solenoid continues for 0.05 seconds or more</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Actuator assembly internal malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1225/25</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, an overcurrent condition continues for 0.1s or more while switching solenoid (SM1 or SM2) ON is output</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, an open circuit condition continues for 0.05s or more while switching solenoid (SM1 or SM2) OFF is output</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, an open circuit condition continues for 0.05s or more while switching solenoid (SM1 or SM2) ON is output</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, a current-flowing condition continues for 0.05s or more while switching solenoid (SM1 or SM2) OFF is output</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, a short to GND in switching solenoid (SM1 or SM2) continues for 0.1s or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the solenoid relay is ON with IG1 terminal voltage at 17.4V or less, a short between switching solenoids SM1 and SM2 continues for 0.1s or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Actuator assembly internal malfunction</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<atten4>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.54in"/>
<thead>
